      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "FRONT-END (Next.js App Router)\n• React 19 + TypeScript (Multi-Nicho)\n• Tailwind CSS + shadcn/ui\n• Schedule-X MIT (Gratis no /painel)\n  + Pilulas leves no Cliente (<50ms 4G)\n• 100% Lucide Icons (0 emojis!)\n• Visual limpo s/ excesso de bordas\n• Motor Zelo: CSS Variables (4 temas)\n• GSAP 3 (so na Landing Page v5)\n• ISR + revalidateTag (/slug, redirect 308)\n• QR Code PIX estatico local (R$0 p/ balcao)\n• Upload Foto WebP <=40KB no navegador\n• PWA + Service Worker (Web Push + guia iOS)",
