      "originalText": "BACK-END & SEGURANCA\n• Next.js API Routes / Actions (server-only)\n• Supabase Postgres 500MB + Supavisor + pg_cron\n• Isolamento Multi-tenant: RLS ativo (loja_id)\n• Trava SQL: EXCLUDE USING gist DEFERRABLE\n  (reordena/adia sem falso erro 23P01!)\n• Trigger limite plano Solo(1) vs Equipe(5)\n• Fuso horario soberano (lojas.timezone BR)\n• Anti-Bot/IA: Turnstile + Upstash Rate Limit\n• Validacao estrita: Zod + blocklist slugs\n• Supabase Auth (Google + trava avatar custom)\n• Storage RLS (avatars <=45KB | lojas <=100KB)\n• Resend 100/dia isolado (429 nunca trava!)",
