      "fontFamily": 5,
      "fontSize": 21,
      "frameId": null,
      "groupIds": [],
      "index": "b1I",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "CAPACIDADE REAL NO PLANO R$ 0,00\n\n• Supabase Postgres (500 MB):\n  Cabe 100 a 500+ lojas ativas,\n  50.000 clientes e 300.000+ reservas\n\n• Supabase Storage (1 GB):\n  ~1.000 lojas completas (WebP <=100KB)\n\n• Gargalo #1: Resend (100 emails/dia)\n  -> Solucao: Usar Web Push PWA gratis\n  e ilimitado + 1-clique WhatsApp!\n\n• Hospedagem Comercial Gratuita:\n  Cloudflare Pages/Workers permite SaaS\n  comercial no Free (Vercel Hobby proibe)",
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 321846939,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "text": "CAPACIDADE REAL NO PLANO R$ 0,00\n\n• Supabase Postgres (500 MB):\n  Cabe 100 a 500+ lojas ativas,\n  50.000 clientes e 300.000+ reservas\n\n• Supabase Storage (1 GB):\n  ~1.000 lojas completas (WebP <=100KB)\n\n• Gargalo #1: Resend (100 emails/dia)\n  -> Solucao: Usar Web Push PWA gratis\n  e ilimitado + 1-clique WhatsApp!\n\n• Hospedagem Comercial Gratuita:\n  Cloudflare Pages/Workers permite SaaS\n  comercial no Free (Vercel Hobby proibe)",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "updated": 1794452008912,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2003828853,
      "verticalAlign": "middle"
    },
    {
      "id": "eng_perf-label",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3080,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 740,
      "height": 340,
      "angle": 0,
      "autoResize": true,
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "boundElements": null,
      "containerId": "eng_perf",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "fontSize": 21,
      "frameId": null,
      "groupIds": [],
      "index": "b1J",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "PERFORMANCE NEXT.JS NO 4G (<50ms)\n\n• Por que o Next.js fica ultra-rapido:\n  Zero SSR dinamico desnecessario!\n\n• 1. Cache ISR + revalidateTag:\n  Paginas /[slug] e /explorar ficam\n  prontas na CDN (0 queries no banco).\n  So atualiza quando o dono salva!\n\n• 2. Indice Composto Parcial (<2ms):\n  (loja_id, prof_id, inicio, fim)\n  Index-Only Scan direto na memoria.\n\n• 3. Mesma Regiao (sa-east-1):\n  Zero latencia extra Brasil <-> EUA.",
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1906340464,
      "strokeColor": "#099268",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "text": "PERFORMANCE NEXT.JS NO 4G (<50ms)\n\n• Por que o Next.js fica ultra-rapido:\n  Zero SSR dinamico desnecessario!\n\n• 1. Cache ISR + revalidateTag:\n  Paginas /[slug] e /explorar ficam\n  prontas na CDN (0 queries no banco).\n  So atualiza quando o dono salva!\n\n• 2. Indice Composto Parcial (<2ms):\n  (loja_id, prof_id, inicio, fim)\n  Index-Only Scan direto na memoria.\n\n• 3. Mesma Regiao (sa-east-1):\n  Zero latencia extra Brasil <-> EUA.",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "updated": 1794452008912,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 455866826,
      "verticalAlign": "middle"
    },
    {
