      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "Storage RLS, Push, Radar, Resend & Webhooks\n• Bucket 'avatars' (<=45KB WebP) & 'lojas-media' (<=100KB)\n• push_subscriptions: Web Push PWA R$0 (prioridade #1!)\n• metricas_diarias_sistema: trava 80/100 emails Resend +\n  try/catch nao-bloqueante (429 nunca quebra reserva!)\n• webhook_events: idempotencia Asaas + revalidateTag()\n  imediato (libera loja no domingo em <1s apos PIX!)\n• vitrine_buscas + audit_logs_admin (/super-admin)",
